From: Xun2202 <98207886+Xun2202@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 13:01:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] downloads: preserve recovery files and support local HLS
 proxy streams

Shared storage deletion and verified-copy guard matches mihon-harmony 0102. Preserve source data when the target cannot be verified. The restore regression uses the older Compose test entry supported by both apps. Anikku additionally serializes canceled download owners, recovers verified duplicate videos, keeps remote retry URLs, and configures supported loopback HLS/HTTP options with redacted native diagnostics.
